>AUTHORITY MODE</span><strong id="mode">BOUND</strong></div><div class="token"><span>GENESIS</span><b id="token-label">#0001</b><i id="chain-tag">LOCAL OBJECT</i></div><dl class="telemetry"><div><dt>EVOLUTIONS</dt><dd id="evolutions">0</dd></div><div><dt>DESCENDANTS</dt><dd id="descendants">0</dd></div><div><dt>GENERATION</dt><dd id="generation">0</dd></div><div><dt>NONCE</dt><dd id="nonce">0</dd></div></dl><div class="root-list"><button class="root" data-root="genome"><span>GENOME</span><code id="genome">—</code></button><button class="root" data-root="root"><span>STATE ROOT</span><code id="root">—</code></button><button class="root" data-root="memory"><span>MEMORY</span><code id="memory-root">—</code></button><button class="root" data-root="audit"><span>AUDIT</span><code id="audit">—</code></button></div><div class="account-block"><span>DETERMINISTIC ACCOUNT</span><code id="account">NOT DEPLOYED · PREVIEW</code></div><div class="panel-foot"><span id="saved">SESSION ONLY</span><button id="portrait">PORTRAIT ↗</button></div></aside>
<aside class="panel proof glass"><div class="panel-title"><span>02</span> CONTROL <button id="hide-panels" class="micro" aria-label="Hide side panels">−</button></div><div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Inspect the organism"><button data-lens="0" class="active" aria-pressed="true">WHOLE</button><button data-lens="2" aria-pressed="false">MEMORY</button><button data-lens="4" aria-pressed="false">LINEAGE</button></div><div class="proof-rail"><div><i class="live"></i><span>IDENTITY <small id="identity-source">LOCAL SHA-256 STATE</small></span><b id="identity-mark">LOCAL</b></div><div><i class="live"></i><span>OPTICAL FIELD <small>SHARED GLSL / WEBASSEMBLY</small></span><b>ACTIVE</b></div><div><i></i><span>CHAIN EXECUTION <small id="chain-status">CONNECT A TESTNET DEPLOYMENT</small></span><b id="chain-mark">OFF</b></div><div><i></i><span>PROOF VERIFIER <small>NO ZK / TEE CLAIM IN PREVIEW</small></span><b id="proof-mark">OFF</b></div></div><div id="lens-detail"><div class="section-label">CONSTITUTION</div><div class="law"><span>01</span><p>Every action binds its prior state.</p></div><div class="law"><span>02</span><p>The past remains read-only.</p></div><div class="law"><span>03</span><p>Ascension cannot be undone.</p></div></div><div class="utility-grid"><button id="entropy">INJECT ENTROPY</button><button id="inspect">RECEIPTS ↗</button><button id="history">HISTORY</button><button id="export">EXPORT</button></div><div class="view-setting"><label for="depth">FOURTH-AXIS SLICE</label><input id="depth" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Fourth-axis slice, visual only"></div><div class="panel-foot"><button id="reference" title="Unmodified original WebGL field">ORIGINAL FIELD</button><button id="quality">QUALITY: AUTO</button></div></aside>
